3. Python Exposure (bridge/sc_neurocore_engine/hdc.py)Create a new module hdc to wrap these raw ops into symbolic algebra.Pythonclass HDCVector:
    def __init__(self, dimension=10000):
        self.data = sc.Bitstream(dimension) # Rust object
    
    def __mul__(self, other):
        # Overload * operator for Binding (XOR)
        return self.xor(other)
    
    def __add__(self, other):
        # Overload + operator for Bundling (Majority)
        return self.bundle(other)
